{"candidateAnswer":"Seattle","evidence":"[D3:19 | 4:21 pm on 16 July, 2023] John: It's Seattle, I'm stoked for my game there next month! It's one of my favorite cities to explore - super vibrant!\n[D5:2 | 10:29 am on 9 August, 2023] John: Hi Tim! Nice to hear from you. Glad you could reconnect. As for me, lots of stuff happened since we last talked. Last week I had a crazy game - crazy intense! We won it by a tight score. Scoring that last basket and hearing the crowd cheer was awesome!\n[D6:1 | 1:08 pm on 11 August, 2023] John: Hey Tim, sorry I missed you. Been a crazy few days. Took a trip to a new place - it's been amazing. Love the energy there.\n[D6:3 | 1:08 pm on 11 August, 2023] John: I was in Chicago, it was awesome! It had so much energy and the locals were really friendly. It's great to experience other cultures and connect with new folks.","itemId":"urn:uuid:5ac9794a-9e89-5d8c-82ed-4f69aad9565a","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:34fc971acfc2e0f093db62c035b71610c137f898e38083fe7c43e4399324baf1","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Which city was John in before traveling to Chicago?","referenceAnswer":"Seattle","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"34fc971acfc2e0f093db62c035b71610c137f898e38083fe7c43e4399324baf1"}}]}